  article.qa.darker
    a name='faq'
    .container
      h3.big-title Frequently Asked Questions
      .columns
        .item
          h4 How am I billed?
          p Each workspace is billed per hour up to its monthly cap. Place the mouse cursor over the monthly price to see the hourly cost.
        .item
          h4 Do I have to pay the full cost of the workspace every time I create a new one?
          p No &mdash; you only need to pay for the hours used. Creating a basic workspace just to test something out for a couple of hours should only cost you a few cents.
        .item
          h4 Am I charged when I enter a credit card?
          p No &mdash; when you enter a card, we only run an authorization charge ($0 or $1 depending on the bank). This authorization is refunded back to your card by your bank in no more than 30 days. Your card will only be charged for any usage on the first of each month.
        .item
          h4 When is my credit card billed?
          p We will charge your credit card on the first day of the month at midnight UTC for the prior month's usage. We will email you with an invoice and a detailed summary of your usage and charges.
        .item
          h4 Why was my first bill cheaper than the other ones?
          p We perform pro-rata hourly calculations at the end of the month. This means if you create a new workspace during the middle of the month, you will be invoiced for ~50% of the monthly price at the start of the next month.
        .item
          h4 Am I charged while my workspace is in a stopped state?
          p Yes &mdash; but only for storage. Place the mouse cursor over the monthly price to see the storage cost.
        .item
          h4 How do I choose between monthly and hourly billing?
          p There is no difference between monthly and hourly billing. All workspaces are billed hourly, up until a monthly cap. We have estimated that each month has about 672 hours (28 days). If you use your workspace for less than 672 hours during the month, you will be billed for each hour that you used it. If you use your workspace for more than 672 hours that month, you will be billed at the monthly cost, which is no greater than 672 hours.
        .item
          h4 Is there a threshold billing amount?
          p We will only bill your card once your account balance hits or exceeds $1.00.
        .item
          h4 What forms of payment do you accept?
          p We accept Visa, MasterCard, American Express, and Discover cards.
        .item
          h4 Do you offer refunds?
          p
            | We do not offer refunds. If you have had a problem with the service, please&nbsp;
            a href="mailto:support@nitrous.io" contact our support team
            | .
        .item
          h4 How do I cancel my account?
          p You can cancel your account anytime through the account settings page after you have terminated all workspaces you own.

      p.centered.solo
        | Have more questions? Please feel free to&nbsp;
        a href="mailto:hello@nitrous.io" target="_blank" send us a message
        | .



